---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { practice } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Website Privacy | Signal & Structure Coaching"
  description="Learn how the Signal & Structure Coaching website handles information visitors may provide and limited technical website data."
  heading="Website Privacy"
  intro="This page explains privacy practices for the Signal & Structure Coaching website and the limited information associated with using it."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>

    <p>
      You may choose to provide information when contacting {practice.name},
      requesting a discovery call, or using a third-party service linked from
      this website.
    </p>

    <p>
      A first message only needs enough information to respond to your request,
      such as your name, contact information, general availability, and a brief
      description of what you would like help with. Avoid sending highly
      sensitive personal, medical, financial, or urgent information through
      ordinary website communication.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Website analytics and technical information</h2>

    <p>
      The website and its hosting or network providers may process basic
      technical information needed to deliver, maintain, and protect the site.
      This may include an IP address, browser or device information, requested
      pages, and the date and time of a request.
    </p>

    <p>
      {practice.name} also uses limited first-party website analytics to
      understand general site use. Analytics may record information such as the
      page being viewed, general device information, an external referring
      hostname, and interactions with selected links or calls to action.
    </p>

    <p>
      Limited browser storage may be used to distinguish activity within a
      visit and to determine whether a browser appears to be new or returning.
      The analytics system is designed to avoid collecting form contents or
      sensitive coaching information as analytics data.
    </p>

    <p>
      The analytics script respects supported browser privacy signals such as
      Global Privacy Control and Do Not Track by preventing analytics
      collection when those signals are enabled.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How information may be used</h2>

    <p>
      Website information may be used to operate and secure the site,
      understand general website use, improve navigation and performance, and
      understand which pages or links are useful to visitors.
    </p>

    <p>
      Information you voluntarily provide through an appropriate contact or
      scheduling system may be used to respond to your request, discuss
      coaching availability or fit, provide requested information, and support
      ordinary business administration.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Third-party services and links</h2>

    <p>
      This website may link to third-party scheduling, communication, payment,
      video-conferencing, or other services. Those providers operate under
      their own terms and privacy practices. {practice.name} does not control
      unrelated external websites or services and is not responsible for their
      content, availability, or privacy practices.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Coaching and sensitive information</h2>

    <p>
      {practice.name} is presented as a coaching practice, not a healthcare or
      mental-health treatment provider. This website is not intended to
      collect medical records, diagnoses, treatment information, or emergency
      communications through ordinary website channels.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Website security</h2>

    <p>
      Reasonable care may be used to operate and protect this website, but no
      website or internet transmission can be guaranteed to be completely
      secure. Avoid sending sensitive or urgent information through ordinary
      website communication.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Changes to this page</h2>

    <p>
      This privacy page may be updated when website features, service
      providers, or business practices change. The version published here is
      the current version.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Privacy questions</h2>

    <p>
      Questions about this website privacy page may be directed to
      {practice.name} using the contact information published on this website.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Demonstration notice</h2>

    <p>
      Signal & Structure Coaching is a fictional business created as a Brighter
      Sites portfolio demonstration. The names, services, and business details
      presented on this demonstration website do not represent an operating
      coaching practice.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
